<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>命理學 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8/</link><description>Recent content in 命理學 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>命理能幫你想職涯問題嗎？把象徵提示變成行動</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%91%BD%E9%81%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%81%8B%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%91%BD%E9%81%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%81%8B%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想換工作時，有人會先看命盤；有人先打開求職網站。兩件事可以並存，但用途要分清：&lt;strong&gt;命理提供詮釋角度，職涯決定仍需現實資料。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>開運儀式怎麼用？把願望落在日常行動</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E8%A8%A3%E8%88%87%E5%84%80%E5%BC%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E8%A8%A3%E8%88%87%E5%84%80%E5%BC%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在重要日子拜拜、整理房間，或把一顆喜歡的石頭放在桌上，可能讓人更願意停下來想：我到底希望什麼改變？儀式可以是提醒，&lt;strong&gt;結果仍取決於具體行動與外在條件&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>